     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Location 613ff118-ceeb-5472-9793-dc241d0d032c</b></p><a name=\"613ff118-ceeb-5472-9793-dc241d0d032c\"> </a><a name=\"hc613ff118-ceeb-5472-9793-dc241d0d032c\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profiles: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-openelis-storage-location.html\">OpenELIS Storage Location</a>, <code>http://ihe.net/fhir/StructureDefinition/IHE.mCSD.Location</code></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Tag: </p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">B3 (cryobox) (http://openelis.org/storage-location-code#OEStorageLocationCode#MAIN-FRZ01-Shelf 1-Rack 2-B3)</p><hr/><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The status of the location\">Status:</td><td>Active</td><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Whether this describes a specific location, or a class of locations\">Mode:</td><td>Instance</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The physical form of the location (e.g. building, room, vehicle, road)\">Form:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes:\">Storage Box</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The type of function performed at the location\">Type:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://openelis.org/fhir/CodeSystem/storage-box-type cryobox}\">cryobox</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Another location this one is physically a part of\">Part Of:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"Location-5a9cc354-9495-5090-91d7-b67b0d2ef5dc.html\">Rack 2 (http://openelis.org/storage-location-code#OEStorageLocationCode#MAIN-FRZ01-Shelf 1-Rack 2)</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"How positions in the box are labelled (for example letter-number). Free text. OpenELIS currently sends this extension with url http://openelis.org/fhir/extension/rack-position-schema-hint (see Known Issues).\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-rack-position-schema-hint.html\">Position schema hint</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">letter-number</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Whether any position in the storage box is occupied. Always sent on box-level Locations. OpenELIS currently sends this extension with url http://openelis.org/fhir/extension/position-occupancy (see Known Issues).\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-position-occupancy.html\">Position occupancy</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">true</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Capacity of the location: the capacity limit of a device or shelf. On a box it is rows x columns and is only sent with rack-grid-dimensions. OpenELIS currently sends this extension with url http://openelis.org/fhir/extension/storage-capacity (see Known Issues).\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-storage-capacity.html\">Storage capacity</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">81</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Grid of a storage box as the string &quot;{rows} × {columns}&quot; (U+00D7 multiplication sign, with spaces), for example &quot;9 × 9&quot;. Parsed on import. OpenELIS currently sends this extension with url http://openelis.org/fhir/extension/rack-grid-dimensions (see Known Issues).\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-rack-grid-dimensions.html\">Grid dimensions</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">9 × 9</td></tr></table></div>"
